<title>ZIMBABWE: SOCCER-ZIMBABWE BEAT TOGO 3-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ZIMBABWE BEAT TOGO 3-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1997-01-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe beat Togo 3-0 (halftime 2-0) in a World Cup African zone, group four qualifying match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Kennedy Chihuri (23)</p>
<p>		 Vitalis Takawira (28 pen, 49)</p>
<p>Attendance: 40,000</p>
</text>
